0-a10f-ad7e2109e50f","senderName":"蒋逾彦","text":"比如她可能会觉得是猫弄倒了灯，或者是她自己梦游。无论多么荒谬，只要能让她逻辑自洽，就是安全的。","timestamp":"2026-04-23T10:24:23.353Z","roundId":"group_round_1776939839171_t37ouml","userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1776938627506","_id":5815},{"id":1776911119020,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"4edbaa93-9a90-492c-9b31-50108407a1cb","senderName":"秦海一","text":"好。","timestamp":"2026-04-23T10:24:23.682Z","roundId":"group_round_1776939839171_t37ouml","userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1776938627506","_id":5817},{"id":1776911119021,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"4edbaa93-9a90-492c-9b31-50108407a1cb","senderName":"秦海一","text":"只要她觉得安全，什么逻辑都行。","timestamp":"2026-04-23T10:24:24.052Z","roundId":"group_round_1776939839171_t37ouml","userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1776938627506","_id":5819},{"id":1776911119022,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"f0183f8f-6499-4851-b940-d9124e251388","senderName":"梁悍宇","text":"{\"t\":\"sticker\",\"m\":\"哼\"}","timestamp":"2026-04-23T10:24:24.566Z","roundId":"group_round_1776939839171_t37ouml","userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1776938627506","_id":5821},{"id":1776911119023,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"f0183f8f-6499-4851-b940-d9124e251388","senderName":"梁悍宇","text":"行吧，老大说是啥就是啥。我撤了，王局那帮人还在等着呢。","timestamp":"2026-04-23T10:24:25.039Z","roundId":"group_round_1776939839171_t37ouml","userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1776938627506","_id":5823},{"id":1776942127327.2122,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"f0183f8f-6499-4851-b940-d9124e251388","senderName":"梁悍宇","text":"操，这帮老狐狸总算滚了。穿这身西装站门口，老子觉得自己像个卖保险的。","timestamp":"2026-04-23T11:02:07.327Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776942127327_7pvutkf","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775848827498","_id":5831},{"id":1776942127483.1057,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"27fbe589-5b6f-4734-ac3d-29a013c74ae9","senderName":"封岳","text":"王局对这次的“诚意”很满意。城西那几条高利